---
import Heading from "../../components/base/Heading.astro";
import Screen from "../../components/compound/Screen.astro";
---

<Screen
  anchor="about"
  background="bg-background"
  color="text-accent"
  next_section="projects"
  hideWave
>
  <div
    class="flex h-full w-full flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-[60%_40%] md:px-52"
  >
    <div
      class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-1 flex-col px-12 py-8 md:px-24 md:py-16"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center gap-y-6">
        <Heading color="text-accent" classList="uppercase mb-6">
          About
        </Heading>
        <p class="max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          Hey there 👋🏼
          <br /><br />
          In case you missed the very large introduction above, I'm Anumeya, a compulsive
          software engineer happy to build and break.
          <br /><br />
          I have been working with tech for the better part of the past decade. Starting
          out with electronics and hardware, I have since indulged in almost all things
          tech.
          <br /><br />
          The starting point of my software journey was the same reason I am now a
          Linux user, a raspberry pi 3b+ back before Covid. This experience has single-handedly
          shaped my philosophy and approach to tech: Software shouldn't assume the
          hardware.
          <br /><br />
          Currently working at <a href="https://heizen.work">Heizen</a> as an SDE.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/blog/philosophy" class="underline">Philosophy</a>
          <a href="#" class="underline">Tech I use</a>
          <a href="#" class="underline">What I support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <img
      src="/dot-matrix.svg"
      alt=""
      class="relative hidden h-full w-full object-cover md:block"
    />
  </div>
</Screen>
